        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taker your time, relax, and join Mimi on her new feline adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi has lost her favorite ball and now depends on you to bring the fun back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from your mistakes, retrace your steps if needed, and find the best way to guide her to her ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi can get distracted by other things or even wet her little paws — but it’s all for one reason: to play with her beloved ball again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you’ll find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥ 60 cozy puzzle levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥ Intuitive and relaxing gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥ Achievements to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥ An adorable kitty that will steal your heart</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taker your time, relax, and join Mimi on her new feline adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi has lost her favorite ball and now depends on you to bring the fun back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from your mistakes, retrace your steps if needed, and find the best way to guide her to her ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi can get distracted by other things or even wet her little paws — but it’s all for one reason: to play with her beloved ball again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you’ll find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥ 60 cozy puzzle levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥ Intuitive and relaxing gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥ Achievements to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥ An adorable kitty that will steal your heart</p>",
